ity:1}} and add overflow-hidden to prevent content flash. Use transition={{duration:0.2,ease:\\\"easeOut\\\"}} for snappy feel.\",\"reasoning\":\"Instant state changes feel jarring and cheap. Animated expansion communicates the relationship between collapsed and expanded states, helping users track where content came from. This is a small change with high perceived quality improvement.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:42:24.687Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:42:24.687Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
